{"title":"2005 OIM Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine all triples of real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/b/31b1e1af4531148cbc079023f68c2b0102c4ee69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y, z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> that satisfy the following system of equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/f/94f7d6eaab85dca74ec09823d71f9d01485cc623.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[xyz = 8\\]\" width=\"61\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/8/e68867b4f78a771589fc3144196c7a928225427a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2y+y^2z+z^2x = 73\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/8669ed666159de5d0d0e94e8f98b19a158cc205b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x(y-z)^2+y(z-x)^2+z(x-y)^2 = 98\\]\" width=\"304\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One can observe:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25eec0b9cb68440757d05f3b5cb50fb0b01304bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x(y-z)^2+y(z-x)^2+z(x-y)^2 = x(y^2+z^2)+y(z^2+x^2)+z(x^2+y^2)-6xyz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"636\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>A little more manipulation and we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/0/b20cb8d062cf81c6225abb91c90d3c1568297e2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^2+yz^2+zx^2 = 73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Subtract this from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/3/d23d4f3cd27b016b7a14fab588c33fc21ec64869.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2y+y^2z+z^2x = 73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>To get: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/0/520b40f8a4a95a22c7e82953d7eae169692f2f70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-(x-y)(y-z)(z-x) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"217\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Implying that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb4aa328b3912ae6c53a1cdd1d3fabd8c14c43d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y, y = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"13\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a58198f4e1af46ca9b4cc5c42030182900c64aa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>WLOG, assume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09c855e158a4b014e988e4240053f4ddd611968.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"10\" />,\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15754b2df75dc9846ca7ade361e84936b00f5b01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\frac{8}{x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/5/885833472f9e8927cbc6c2184dd683eb9212095b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2y+y^2x+x^3 = 73$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"161\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Implying, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3e0d14ee86d7973db47ebe5361a6e280c0cabe1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{64}{x^3}+x^3 = 65$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4ff8bbad79fc034a1b35329acef5492dc937ecd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/3/1f3cc0ad966b3e637cd199607cbf0d1befc0e491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/4/2a47c2e377e1b46d32da9683ae8bea20d18f59c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y,z) =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> permutations of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/2/382c01b213357281e0fbd2239cf7fdca37a7e804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,8,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/8/4b83832ec01f46ba041fade3751821f933e1052e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4,4,\\frac{1}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~creativeRaven\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017022924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 113/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3837/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26324:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017022924 and revision id 246061. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}